Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.7.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://supralinux.com

Package: supralinux-snap-policy
Architecture: all
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: SupraLINUX default policy that blocks Snap installation through APT
 This package installs the reversible APT preferences used by SupraLINUX to
 prevent snapd and Plasma's Snap software-store backend from being installed
 automatically.
 .
 Removing this package removes the policy only. It does not install snapd.
